    old "What did you say...?!"
    new "なんだとお......!"

    old "U-Um, Saito-san, Miss Valliere, please calm down."
    new "あのあの、サイトさんも、ミス・ヴァリエールも、落ち着いてください。"

    old "Hmph..."
    new "ふーん......。"

    old "Hey, Louise? Could it be... you're jealous?"
